   That is the whole loop. To land a change:

   [2m1. [0mRun the checks:
   [2m   ┌ sh ────[0m[copy][2m─┐[0m
   [2m   │[0m   bun quality [2m│[0m
   [2m   └───────────────┘[0m
   [2m2. [0mCommit on main once every check has passed and the tree is clean, so whoever picks the work up next starts from a
   [2m   [0mbuild that runs.

   Then build the binary with:

   [2m┌ sh ────────────────────────────────────────────[0m[copy][2m─┐[0m
   [2m│[0m   bun dev compile --all                               [2m│[0m
   [2m│[0m   for bin in dist/*/chord; do echo "built $bin"; done [2m│[0m
   [2m└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘[0m

